# - uxr-canvas-noise=true (public --fingerprint-canvas-noise) opts into the
#   seeded LSB readback/export noise (GpuBackendPolicy.canvas_pixel_noise).
# - Uniform neighborhoods stay native: solid fills read back byte-exact,
#   only edge/texture pixels that differ from a neighbor carry seeded noise.
